{
    "title": "Arabian Piano \u0628\u064a\u0627\u0646\u0648 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628",
    "description": "~ \u062a\u0645 \u062a\u062d\u0648\u064a\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0628\u064a\u0627\u0646\u0648 \u0625\u0644\u0649 \u0627\u0648\u0631\u063a \u0634\u0631\u0642\u064a ~\r\n\r\n\u266c \u0628\u064a\u0627\u0646\u0648 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628 \u266a \u0623\u0648\u0631\u063a \u0634\u0631\u0642\u064a \u266c\r\n\u266a\u266c \u0628\u064a\u0627\u0646\u0648 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u062d\u062a\u0631\u0641 \u266c\u266a\r\n=============\r\n~The piano was converted into an oriental organ~\r\n\r\n\u266c Arab Piano \u266a Oriental Organ \u266c\r\n\u266a\u266c Professional Piano \u266c\u266a\r\n=============\r\n\u25a0 Free professional organ\r\n\u25a0 It has a learning feature through falling squares on the piano keys\r\nNew \u25a0 The piano has been completely upgraded and converted to an organ\r\nNew \u25a0 Contains 6 different piano sounds such as oud, flute, Abdul Salam Al-Masry flute, Yamaha piano sound, and more\r\nNew \u25a0 Contains popular concerts such as the Levantine Majouz (My Love, Dubai) and Iraqi folk concerts such as (Derry Balk)\r\nNew \u25a0 Contains 15 popular rhythm sounds from all countries of the Arab world. The speed of the rhythm and its volume can be controlled\r\nNew \u25a0 Contains infinite fixed notes to help make your instrumentals more professional\r\nNew \u25a0 Contains more than 30 Arabic songs and instrumentals for you to learn and play professionally\r\nNew \u25a0 Improve the learning system and give a result when learning is completed\r\n\u25a0 It has a professional recording feature\r\n\u25a0 New songs are added every few days\r\n\u25a0 The ability to control the speed of education\r\n\u25a0 Possibility of manual or automatic play for education\r\n\r\n\u25a0 The piano sound is pure and high quality\r\n\u25a0 Org is a new free Arabic song game\r\n\u25a0 Professional Arab Piano, the unparalleled piano\r\n\u25a0 Arabic keyboard. Learn to play Arabic and foreign songs\r\n\u25a0 More songs have been added, such as the Saudi and Iraqi national anthems (My Homeland) and the Egyptian national anthems (My Country)\r\n\u25a0 Added how to play Despacito song\r\n\u25a0 Added the song 3 Daqat - Abu Yousra\r\n\u25a0 The song Ya Lili - Balti has been added\r\nNew \u25a0 Kazem\u2019s song \u201cQadalk Ala Al-Darb Qaoud\u201d has been added\r\nNew \u25a0 The song Elissa, the most beautiful feeling in the universe, has been added\r\nNew \u25a0 Athan ringtone has been added\r\nNew \u25a0 The Moroccan national anthem has been added\r\nNew \u25a0 The intro song for the anime Sniper has been added\r\nNew \u25a0 A sweet song, oh my country, has been added\r\nNew \u25a0 Added Sheila I visited the cemetery\r\nNew \u25a0 The Iraqi national anthem has been added\r\n\u25a0 A real piano with great sound and great capabilities\r\n\u25a0 More and more songs will be added!!!\r\n\u25a0 Professional piano without the Internet, without the Internet, for all Arabs!\r\n\u25a0 The size of the piano is small, not exceeding 25 MB\r\n\u25a0 Free new Arabic music and playing",
    "descriptionHTML": "~ \u062a\u0645 \u062a\u062d\u0648\u064a\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0628\u064a\u0627\u0646\u0648 \u0625\u0644\u0649 \u0627\u0648\u0631\u063a \u0634\u0631\u0642\u064a ~<br><br>\u266c \u0628\u064a\u0627\u0646\u0648 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628 \u266a \u0623\u0648\u0631\u063a \u0634\u0631\u0642\u064a \u266c<br>\u266a\u266c \u0628\u064a\u0627\u0646\u0648 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u062d\u062a\u0631\u0641 \u266c\u266a<br>=============<br>~The piano was converted into an oriental organ~<br><br>\u266c Arab Piano \u266a Oriental Organ \u266c<br>\u266a\u266c Professional Piano \u266c\u266a<br>=============<br>\u25a0 Free professional organ<br>\u25a0 It has a learning feature through falling squares on the piano keys<br>New \u25a0 The piano has been completely upgraded and converted to an organ<br>New \u25a0 Contains 6 different piano sounds such as oud, flute, Abdul Salam Al-Masry flute, Yamaha piano sound, and more<br>New \u25a0 Contains popular concerts such as the Levantine Majouz (My Love, Dubai) and Iraqi folk concerts such as (Derry Balk)<br>New \u25a0 Contains 15 popular rhythm sounds from all countries of the Arab world. The speed of the rhythm and its volume can be controlled<br>New \u25a0 Contains infinite fixed notes to help make your instrumentals more professional<br>New \u25a0 Contains more than 30 Arabic songs and instrumentals for you to learn and play professionally<br>New \u25a0 Improve the learning system and give a result when learning is completed<br>\u25a0 It has a professional recording feature<br>\u25a0 New songs are added every few days<br>\u25a0 The ability to control the speed of education<br>\u25a0 Possibility of manual or automatic play for education<br><br>\u25a0 The piano sound is pure and high quality<br>\u25a0 Org is a new free Arabic song game<br>\u25a0 Professional Arab Piano, the unparalleled piano<br>\u25a0 Arabic keyboard. Learn to play Arabic and foreign songs<br>\u25a0 More songs have been added, such as the Saudi and Iraqi national anthems (My Homeland) and the Egyptian national anthems (My Country)<br>\u25a0 Added how to play Despacito song<br>\u25a0 Added the song 3 Daqat - Abu Yousra<br>\u25a0 The song Ya Lili - Balti has been added<br>New \u25a0 Kazem\u2019s song \u201cQadalk Ala Al-Darb Qaoud\u201d has been added<br>New \u25a0 The song Elissa, the most beautiful feeling in the universe, has been added<br>New \u25a0 Athan ringtone has been added<br>New \u25a0 The Moroccan national anthem has been added<br>New \u25a0 The intro song for the anime Sniper has been added<br>New \u25a0 A sweet song, oh my country, has been added<br>New \u25a0 Added Sheila I visited the cemetery<br>New \u25a0 The Iraqi national anthem has been added<br>\u25a0 A real piano with great sound and great capabilities<br>\u25a0 More and more songs will be added!!!<br>\u25a0 Professional piano without the Internet, without the Internet, for all Arabs!<br>\u25a0 The size of the piano is small, not exceeding 25 MB<br>\u25a0 Free new Arabic music and playing",
